{"4579120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "归墟GuiXu", "steam_appid": 4579120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Guixu</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Guixu</i> is a dark-style loot ARPG based on immortal cultivation lore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In ancient times, when spiritual energy thrived on Blue Planet, practitioners broke human limits by cultivating Qi. Mortals called them immortals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain power beyond mortals, slay demons, compete with peers, adventure with friends to reach the apex of the Dao, or wander the ancient world alone. Master your fate in this mystical era.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579120/extras/98e56840ae630e0f8364e715ff7056f3.poster.avif?t=1779325620\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579120/extras/98e56840ae630e0f8364e715ff7056f3.webm?t=1779325620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579120/extras/98e56840ae630e0f8364e715ff7056f3.mp4?t=1779325620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Guixu.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ink-wash open world shrouded in mythical dangers. Traverse forests, villages, caves and secret realms for rare resources. Refine artifacts and pills to advance your cultivation, gain supreme power and eternal lifespan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move freely without mouse clicking; aim, cast spells and dodge projectiles with WASD or cursor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579120/extras/d5bc2ff7d697ce9b250480155459f2ad.poster.avif?t=1779325620\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579120/extras/d5bc2ff7d697ce9b250480155459f2ad.webm?t=1779325620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579120/extras/d5bc2ff7d697ce9b250480155459f2ad.mp4?t=1779325620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579120/extras/348e58a5e11e3a8014df0abdac280aef.poster.avif?t=1779325620\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579120/extras/348e58a5e11e3a8014df0abdac280aef.webm?t=1779325620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579120/extras/348e58a5e11e3a8014df0abdac280aef.mp4?t=1779325620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immersive Character Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create and customize your immortal. Master unique builds from countless techniques. Forge your path with spells, treasures and spiritual roots to show your distinct style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579120/extras/f25b3392912837c91d8ca017d135ee69.poster.avif?t=1779325620\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579120/extras/f25b3392912837c91d8ca017d135ee69.webm?t=1779325620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579120/extras/f25b3392912837c91d8ca017d135ee69.mp4?t=1779325620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Legendary Treasures &amp; Epic Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore powerful gear combinations and fight fearlessly. Break through realms, collect supreme treasures, and dominate even the deadliest foes.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579120/extras/4228d4f5b5c6e61cf2bf47c129de59b8.poster.avif?t=1779325620\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579120/extras/4228d4f5b5c6e61cf2bf47c129de59b8.webm?t=1779325620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579120/extras/4228d4f5b5c6e61cf2bf47c129de59b8.mp4?t=1779325620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579120/extras/0b67cfa29ea65e795f5b9b2c09c55099.poster.avif?t=1779325620\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579120/extras/0b67cfa29ea65e795f5b9b2c09c55099.webm?t=1779325620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579120/extras/0b67cfa29ea65e795f5b9b2c09c55099.mp4?t=1779325620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master Dao &amp; Cultivation Arts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn various cultivation skills. Defeat enemies to obtain skills and combine them with treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master non-combat arts: artifact forging, pill refining, formations, beast taming and puppetry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pills boost your cultivation and realm breakthroughs. Sell them for better treasures and skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your journey, find your perfect build of treasures and spells, and achieve True Immortality!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579120/extras/b1d4cca6834cdbd0d6b64228d8b25c3f.poster.avif?t=1779325620\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579120/extras/b1d4cca6834cdbd0d6b64228d8b25c3f.webm?t=1779325620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579120/extras/b1d4cca6834cdbd0d6b64228d8b25c3f.mp4?t=1779325620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Guixu</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Guixu</i> is a dark-style loot ARPG based on immortal cultivation lore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In ancient times, when spiritual energy thrived on Blue Planet, practitioners broke human limits by cultivating Qi. Mortals called them immortals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain power beyond mortals, slay demons, compete with peers, adventure with friends to reach the apex of the Dao, or wander the ancient world alone. Master your fate in this mystical era.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579120/extras/98e56840ae630e0f8364e715ff7056f3.poster.avif?t=1779325620\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579120/extras/98e56840ae630e0f8364e715ff7056f3.webm?t=1779325620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579120/extras/98e56840ae630e0f8364e715ff7056f3.mp4?t=1779325620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Guixu.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ink-wash open world shrouded in mythical dangers. Traverse forests, villages, caves and secret realms for rare resources. Refine artifacts and pills to advance your cultivation, gain supreme power and eternal lifespan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move freely without mouse clicking; aim, cast spells and dodge projectiles with WASD or cursor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579120/extras/d5bc2ff7d697ce9b250480155459f2ad.poster.avif?t=1779325620\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579120/extras/d5bc2ff7d697ce9b250480155459f2ad.webm?t=1779325620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579120/extras/d5bc2ff7d697ce9b250480155459f2ad.mp4?t=1779325620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579120/extras/348e58a5e11e3a8014df0abdac280aef.poster.avif?t=1779325620\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579120/extras/348e58a5e11e3a8014df0abdac280aef.webm?t=1779325620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579120/extras/348e58a5e11e3a8014df0abdac280aef.mp4?t=1779325620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immersive Character Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create and customize your immortal. Master unique builds from countless techniques. Forge your path with spells, treasures and spiritual roots to show your distinct style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline 