325620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master Dao &amp; Cultivation Arts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn various cultivation skills. Defeat enemies to obtain skills and combine them with treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master non-combat arts: artifact forging, pill refining, formations, beast taming and puppetry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pills boost your cultivation and realm breakthroughs. Sell them for better treasures and skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your journey, find your perfect build of treasures and spells, and achieve True Immortality!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579120/extras/b1d4cca6834cdbd0d6b64228d8b25c3f.poster.avif?t=1779325620\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579120/extras/b1d4cca6834cdbd0d6b64228d8b25c3f.webm?t=1779325620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579120/extras/b1d4cca6834cdbd0d6b64228d8b25c3f.mp4?t=1779325620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "As a mortal, you were unexpectedly chosen by the Scroll of Guixu and began your immortal journey. Protected by its power, you keep your true self through endless reincarnations. Explore secret realms, seek divine opportunities, and ultimately ascend to become a True Immortal.", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579120/098b1ba9a95634c88b404528ec8faa2c5edadc68/header.jpg?t=1779325620", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579120/00035b